I have used POPPR on diploid SSR data and have been successful. Thanks it is a great tool. I would appreciate advice on the entry of triploid SSR data. I generated a file in Genalex format but with three columns per locus instead of two and then tried to import using read.genalex and setting the ploidy to 3 but kept generating an error message (sorry I did not make a note of it).   Could you provide a sample dataset and specific instructions on how to get triploid data in please. BTW the triploid example on Shiny R works fine. Cheers  David

